message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - name: "Mathias Steinhuber"
title: "bohnasa: exact diagonalization for bosonic quantum many-body systems"
description: >-
  Exact-diagonalization tools for bosonic quantum many-body systems in the
  fixed particle-number Fock sector, including Lanczos recursion and Krylov
  complexity after a quench.
repository-code: "https://github.com/mattlST/bohnasa"
